{"title":"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(specific)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (specific)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(general)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (general)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Only_one_variable)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Only one variable)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is possible to place positive integers into the vacant twenty-one squares of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/197151a067f49bd4daa1952d1a4fac322409f0a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> square shown below so that the numbers in each row and column form arithmetic sequences.  Find the number that must occupy the vacant square marked by the asterisk (*).\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:1988_AIME-6.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/c/c6/1988_AIME-6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"193\" height=\"193\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_1_.28specific.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(specific)\">Solution 1 (specific)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (specific)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let the coordinates of the square at the bottom left be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, the square to the right <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a306093bbd9e0699c65dba033c9483cd379dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, etc.\n</p><p>Label the leftmost column (from bottom to top) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/4363c2e1dafd1649e15e22c7c11d11c9bc128cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, a, 2a, 3a, 4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" /> and the bottom-most row (from left to right) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/1/f812ede35b65cad1f7278f70447a1a92949f7d44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, b, 2b, 3b, 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" />. Our method will be to use the given numbers to set up equations to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and then calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d02e715e7f7195675151570530c5b62ba7b2744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104fc90c8563631420a18e19eda82246ea0c2216.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}[b]{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline 4a &amp; &amp; &amp; * &amp; \\\\ \\hline 3a &amp; 74 &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 2a &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; 186 \\\\ \\hline a &amp; &amp; 103 &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 0 &amp; b &amp; 2b &amp; 3b &amp; 4b \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"202\" height=\"105\" />\n</p><p>We can compute the squares at the intersections of two existing numbers in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />; two such equations will give us the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. On the fourth row from the bottom, the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99d9cce67848714dde06e75a906b95c8ce54302.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74 - 3a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, so the square at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> has a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/461922e58ada89a1ea1857e76bda1b2589003c89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$148 - 3a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />. On the third column from the left, the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/b/1ebdf3d1d7f67562084f4a1a4c98f503f3d6c30e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$103 - 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />, so that square also has a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b628319ff40036c6e43cf73053a5ee76712b40b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 3(103 - 2b) = 309 - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"18\" />. Equating, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d83bf1b4036e24ff5280d7a60f67323670e3f120.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$148 - 3a = 309 - 4b \\Longrightarrow 4b - 3a = 161$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"306\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Now we compute the square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/b/b2b596a120dcf60e33c7bfe19003bb1675bf37a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. By rows, this value is simply the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b7a198fe50fc705ae2ae67870167886d18cc7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$186$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, so it is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/4/d14e6ecc6b0d65a8dcac987cab4680e1cadc15ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a + 186}{2} = a + 93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"146\" height=\"37\" />. By columns, the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/b/1ebdf3d1d7f67562084f4a1a4c98f503f3d6c30e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$103 - 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />, so our value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf89ac9a766cd89ad90bb5eddfe6a2595f72c80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$206 - 2b$\" width=\"66\" height=\"12\" />. Equating, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e2817ffdf11e1b5f9acc664b950cd3e12d3853a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 93 = 206 - 2b \\Longrightarrow a + 2b = 113$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"279\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Solving \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f8499eab77a1e1f45754f8235168316c5775a68e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}4b - 3a &amp;= 161\\\\ a + 2b &amp;= 113 \\end{align*}\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d72ad5077eb5c03603173e6c6523fd0efc0616.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/f/84fbb641e7e5111839a2fb615fd5ebb5bba92995.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. Now it is simple to calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/563948106c3332662355412547d99acab218c16f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. One way to do it is to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/b/b2b596a120dcf60e33c7bfe19003bb1675bf37a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/799ce82d33189723200e9a5fb363602c797dfd68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$206 - 2b = 106$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"117\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb9265e7854534e5c082e16eb10470d08d46e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b7a198fe50fc705ae2ae67870167886d18cc7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$186$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/8790f46883a296366f038323844601dd2cde9ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a19ddd90f87aa30cb592926d143909804f0a2e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{106 + 186}{2} = 146$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" />. Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af424ab2c41e93a9e7ab081dee423809b2ba735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e9699f3ed0b051f9a44756f5722a97b7a568da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b = 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/8/528bdac1ceb4109a7cb9cec53124141caedca3e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,2) = \\frac{(3,0) + (3,4)}{2} \\Longrightarrow (3,4) = * = \\boxed{142}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"348\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_2_.28general.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(general)\">Solution 2 (general)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (general)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a85c47633c9b2ff9d6d19f15991938d116632384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"10\" /> the number to be placed in the first column, fourth row.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/c/29c42fa443adbef221d28478ebe392db1a4cf44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b =$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> the number to be placed in the second column, fifth row.  We can determine the entire first column and fifth row in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55971033f002187dc3608de8418553995b731ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}[b]{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline 4a &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 3a &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 2a &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline a &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 0 &amp; b &amp; 2b &amp; 3b &amp; 4b \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}$\" width=\"179\" height=\"104\" />\n</p><p>Next, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/8771e8230bd8d0180bb6236a1b8c9edf80de93e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" /> the number to be placed in the second column, fourth row.  We can determine the entire second column and fourth row in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06ce47c5f90d3bb1943a6a4b35d55b0f485f9862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}[b]{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline 4a &amp; 4a + b + 4c &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 3a &amp; 3a + b + 3c &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 2a &amp; 2a + b + 2c &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline a &amp; a + b + c &amp; a + 2b + 2c &amp; a + 3b + 3c &amp; a + 4b + 4c \\\\ \\hline 0 &amp; b &amp; 2b &amp; 3b &amp; 4b \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}$\" width=\"475\" height=\"104\" />\n</p><p>We have now determined at least two values in each row and column.  We can finish the table without introducing any more variables:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5dbaa0d43ee82319311a26263eed54f5970701f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}[b]{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline 4a &amp; 4a + b + 4c &amp; 4a + 2b + 8c &amp; 4a + 3b + 12c &amp; 4a + 4b + 16c \\\\ \\hline 3a &amp; 3a + b + 3c &amp; 3a + 2b + 6c &amp; 3a + 3b + 9c &amp; 3a + 4b + 12c \\\\ \\hline 2a &amp; 2a + b + 2c &amp; 2a + 2b + 4c &amp; 2a + 3b + 6c &amp; 2a + 4b + 8c \\\\ \\hline a &amp; a + b + c &amp; a + 2b + 2c &amp; a + 3b + 3c &amp; a + 4b + 4c \\\\ \\hline 0 &amp; b &amp; 2b &amp; 3b &amp; 4b \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}$\" width=\"517\" height=\"104\" />\n</p><p>We now have a system of equations.\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b3419521a5a8f09d705cd757cfe37f3c83a2e81a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + b + 3c = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"14\" /><br />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b641f2abe9660c41d573cb0b4f5ca61d12cbf307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 4b + 8c = 186$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"14\" /><br />\n</p>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fba2f85e6e7ff43c0249d2649837f4fd6098acf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 2b + 2c = 103$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" /></div>\n<p>Solving, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed0992f59ea258ca7b3f6c0d67cc2512e33d0a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c) = (13,50, - 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />.  The number in the square marked by the asterisk is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/7/d4779e1a3eaeca41c0de3be4aafe08ca0f9e1c63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a + 3b + 12c = \\boxed{142}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Only_one_variable.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Only_one_variable)\">Solution 3 (Only one variable)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Only one variable)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We begin with the table that was given to us and add in the following arithmetic progression on the bottom:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/1/cd1e68fb8f4890a0678bdc33585a8cc252b6327c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}[b]{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline &amp; &amp; &amp; * &amp; \\\\ \\hline &amp; 74 &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; 186 \\\\ \\hline &amp; &amp; 103 &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\hline 0 &amp; x &amp; 2x &amp; 3x &amp; 4x \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"193\" height=\"105\" />\n</p><p>Since all the rows and columns satisfy an arithmetic progression, we have the following:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/014bea7d4186523c60aee211ce9f10cdcf77aa21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}[b]{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline &amp; &amp; 412 - 6x &amp; 392 - 5x &amp; 372 - 4x \\\\ \\hline &amp; 74 &amp; 309 - 4x  &amp; 294 - 3x  &amp; 279 - 2x \\\\ \\hline &amp; &amp; 206 - 2x &amp; 196 - x &amp; 186 \\\\ \\hline &amp; &amp; 103 &amp; 98 + x &amp; 2x + 93 \\\\ \\hline 0 &amp; x &amp; 2x &amp; 3x &amp; 4x \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"302\" height=\"105\" />\n</p><p>We can solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the 2nd row, namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/1/cf19da3d16947cefa22f42e005acaadf1eaa0a55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$324 - 5x = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" /> because the arithmetic progression from left to right has difference <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/6683e560572dea63dd2c88091d6c7bebc3bd0905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e7837115e1be9088e025627e0228c52086497d0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 50$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, and because the desired asterisk is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2afbea8e9471a8406b0e31c385d3fb4b4b05d39a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$392 - 5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb876b1bfc7cf36c7bbebc153408c03d14d7b272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$392 - 250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/19995eccb6a5e4c1bbae763ae04fab117547d1b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {142}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Arcticturn\n</p><p>Note: Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/056083bc2e5a7fc6dae8a2c494f9aa68b45b6948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$324-5x=74,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" /> we can just say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755a5e5e343651906536107d508689800171193a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$392-5x = 74 + (324-5x) = 74 + 68,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"306\" height=\"20\" /> which gets us the same answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/5/5b518acd8dcf470decc0bf927500a77479957d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{142}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"45\" height=\"25\" /> \n~PrimeParadox (also thank you Arcticturn, this solution really helped)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME\" title=\"1988 AIME\">1988 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180829\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 421/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13798/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.078      1 -total\n 60.06%    7.855      1 Template:AIME_box\n 37.57%    4.914      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2842:|#|